{10}{What do you mean? I've been out here for months looking for this damned gem! The monsters I've had to fight and the ludicrous things people had me do for them so that they would tell me the slightest bit of information! You wouldn't believe it!}{What do you mean? I've been out here for months looking for this damned gem! The monsters I've had to fight and the ludicrous things people had me do for them so that they would tell me the slightest bit of information! You wouldn't believe it!}{}{}{}{ }
